<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's STB bank starts bond fund.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's STB bank starts bond fund.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Societe Tunisienne de Banque  STB on Wednesday said subscriptions to an open-ended bond investment fund called SICAV-L'Epargnant it has recently set up would start on February 20.</p>
<p>The fund's initial capital was set at 500,000 dinars in 5,000 shares of 100 dinars each.</p>
<p>SICAV-L'Epargnant will be Tunisia's eighth open-ended bond investment fund. ($=1.07 dinar) Tunis newsroom, 216-1-787538</p>
</text>
